  - q: "Does the wheel accommodate users with motion sensitivity or vestibular disorders?"
    a: "Yes. The random name picker respects your device's system-level accessibility preferences. When 'prefers-reduced-motion' is active, spinning animations are bypassed entirely. Instead of rotational motion, the tool computes the winning slice instantly and opens the winner dialog immediately, ensuring full comfort and safety for users sensitive to animated motion effects."
  - q: "Is there a limit on how many names I can paste into the wheel?"
