                <h2>Why Use a Digital Random Name Picker Wheel?</h2>
                <p>Whether you are running a social media giveaway, choosing students for classroom participation, organizing team secret Santa exchanges, or deciding who pays for coffee, choosing fairly is essential. Physical drawings with paper slips take time to assemble and can raise suspicions of bias. Digital spinning wheels provide a transparent, engaging, and verifiably fair method for picking winners in real time.</p>

                <h2>Cryptographically Secure Randomness</h2>
                <p>Many online wheels rely on standard pseudorandom number generators like <code>Math.random()</code>, which are fine for basic games but exhibit predictable mathematical patterns over repeated runs. Our tool utilizes the browser's native <strong>Web Crypto API (<code>crypto.getRandomValues</code>)</strong>. This provides hardware-level entropy and cryptographically strong randomness, guaranteeing that every single spin is completely independent and un-biased.</p>

